Two App Servers for horizontal scaling

11
00:00:28,153 --> 00:00:30,653
A Database and Cache to complete the tier

12
00:00:35,265 --> 00:00:39,265
Connect components by dragging from port dots — rules are enforced automatically

13
00:00:38,592 --> 00:00:41,092
Load Balancer distributes traffic to both App Servers

14
00:00:44,011 --> 00:00:46,511
App Servers hit Cache first, then fall back to the Database

15
00:00:54,585 --> 00:00:57,585
Architecture wired — 6 components, 6 connections

16
00:00:56,086 --> 00:01:00,086
Hit Run Sim — live traffic flows through your design instantly

17
00:01:00,438 --> 00:01:04,438
All green — healthy system at 100 users, latency well within SLA

18
