Click any node to inspect live stats: load %, latency, P95, and SLA status

19
00:01:04,554 --> 00:01:08,054
Metrics update tick-by-tick as traffic flows through the node

20
00:01:06,971 --> 00:01:10,971
Click an edge to see live throughput and set custom traffic split percentages

