The Architecture Cockpit shows real-time cost, health score, and node counts

26
00:01:17,304 --> 00:01:20,304
Minimize to a compact ring indicator for more canvas space

27
00:01:18,809 --> 00:01:21,809
Expand back to the full cockpit to see the complete breakdown

28
